tion would be great.\nI will leave the composition and background to you.\n\nWe would appreciate your consideration.\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UXDvxEnXFXwNuF6SoTe7T0baKlxADios?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@KCC_9646/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/776ac574/uploads/origins/7de684f2-5d66-4459-9860-9a18e83efdda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2263171b82bf886c77e13df26834d4ac", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/776ac574/uploads/origins/7de684f2-5d66-4459-9860-9a18e83efdda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2263171b82bf886c77e13df26834d4ac, https://si.imgix.net/776ac574/uploads/origins/7de684f2-5d66-4459-9860-9a18e83efdda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6d9557354aac3d2517c50c93488eab7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/776ac574/uploads/origins/7de684f2-5d66-4459-9860-9a18e83efdda?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e9b1a1a37d3af9227a61bb2820ba30f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nI always enjoy looking at your wonderful illustrations!\nI would like to apply today, and I would like to request this time!\n\nThe illustration is of my character from FF14!\nI would be happy if you could draw her as a Samurai Mirapuri with larger breasts!\nI would like her expression to be sexy and bewitching.\nThe pose and composition is up to you!\nI would like the background to be Japanese style, and I would like it to be original!\n\nChest: 100 (max)\n\nWeapon: Shore to Shore\nHead: Lily ornament: white\nBody: Yotsuuru body suit\nHands: None\nLegs: Monkaku leg robe (dyed jet black)\nFeet: Eastern shoes\nEars: Trithereia earrings: white\n\n\nI will also post a screenshot of the reference material for your reference!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LbHpQFeOk6l7xtgPKgp79McliU8xhjJc?usp=sharing", "created_at"